				musician</i>, <i>singer</i>, <i>minstrel</i> (mentioned by <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 8, § 57</span></i>
			Müll.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vetus et nobilior Ario cantator fidibus fuit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					16, 19</span></i>
